  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You will take on the role of an airplane pilot who must control his aircraft,
    moving up and down and collecting stars that will be on your way. However, not
    everything is so simple - there will be wind currents on your way that will push
    you down or up, which will complicate your flight.

    If you go off screen,
    your plane will take damage, so be careful and control your position. You have
    several hearts and if you lose all of them the game will end.

    Your main
    goal is to survive as long as possible and reach the end point. The path is displayed
    at the top, so you will always know how much is left to the finish. Collect as
    many stars as possible and try to set a new record!                                                                                               '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e62748a4779ee9428d6666093202278, type: 2}
